Common Period [2757]
    documentation "The time period for which the information is applicable or effective."
    date BeginDate [2758]
        documentation "The month, day, and year for the start of the period.  Note: Date interpretation may vary. Ed-Fi recommends inclusive dates, but states may define dates as inclusive or exclusive. For calculations, align with local guidelines."
        is part of identity
    date EndDate [2759]
        documentation "The month, day, and year for the end of the period.  Note: Date interpretation may vary. Ed-Fi recommends inclusive dates, but states may define dates as inclusive or exclusive. For calculations, align with local guidelines."
